<#ftl output_format="HTML" auto_esc=true>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">

<head>
  <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0;">
  <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no" />

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      min-width: 100%;
      width: 100% !important;
      height: 100% !important;
    }

    body,
    table,
    td,
    div,
    p,
    a {
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      line-height: 100%;
    }

    table,
    td {
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
      border-collapse: collapse !important;
      border-spacing: 0;
    }

    img {
      border: 0;
      line-height: 100%;
      outline: none;
      text-decoration: none;
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
    }

    #outlook a {
      padding: 0;
    }

    .ReadMsgBody {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ExternalClass {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ExternalClass,
    .ExternalClass p,
    .ExternalClass span,
    .ExternalClass font,
    .ExternalClass td,
    .ExternalClass div {
      line-height: 100%;
    }

    @media all and (min-width: 560px) {
      body {
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      .container {
        margin-top: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        -webkit-border-radius: 8px;
        -moz-border-radius: 8px;
        -khtml-border-radius: 8px;
      }
    }

    a,
    a:hover {
      color: #4F46E5;
    }

    .footer a,
    .footer a:hover {
      color: #999999;
    }
  </style>

  <title>Welcome to SmartPrüfung – Let’s Get Started!</title>
</head>

<body dir="ltr"
  topmargin="0"
  rightmargin="0"
  bottommargin="0"
  leftmargin="0"
  marginwidth="0"
  marginheight="0"
  width="100%"
  style="
    border-collapse: collapse;
    border-spacing: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    text-size-adjust: 100%;
    -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    line-height: 100%;
    background-color: #F0F0F0;
    color: #000000;
  "
  bgcolor="#F0F0F0"
  text="#000000"
>
  <table
    width="100%"
    align="center"
    border="0"
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    style="
      border-collapse: collapse;
      border-spacing: 0;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100%;
    "
  >
    <tr>
      <td
        align="center"
        valign="top"
        bgcolor="#F0F0F0"
        style="
          border-collapse: collapse;
          border-spacing: 0;
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0;
        "
      >

        <table
          border="0"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          align="center"
          bgcolor="#FFFFFF"
          width="560"
          style="
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border-spacing: 0;
            padding: 0;
            width: inherit;
            max-width: 560px;
          "
          class="container"
        >
          <tr>
            <td
              align="left"
              valign="top"
              style="
                border-collapse: collapse;
                border-spacing: 0;
                margin: 0;
                padding-left: 6.25%;
                padding-right: 6.25%;
                padding-top: 30px;
                padding-bottom: 30px;
                width: 87.5%;
                font-size: 17px;
                font-weight: 400;
                line-height: 160%;
                color: #000000;
                font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
              "
            >

<p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">Hi ${(firstName!'')},</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">Welcome to <strong>SmartPrüfung</strong>! 🎉</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">We’re happy to have you here. SmartPrüfung helps you prepare for German language exams in a realistic digital exam environment. Practice under exam-like conditions, check your results, understand your mistakes, and build confidence before the real exam.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">You can currently prepare for <strong>TELC Deutsch B1</strong>, including:</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">• Reading comprehension (Leseverstehen)<br>• Language elements (Sprachbausteine)<br>• Listening comprehension (Hörverstehen)<br>• Written expression (Schriftlicher Ausdruck)</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;"><strong>Your account includes 1 free exam</strong>, so you can try SmartPrüfung before purchasing anything.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;"><strong>Here’s how to get started:</strong></p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">1. Log in to your <a href="https://app.smartpruefung.com/?lang=en" target="_blank" style="color: #4F46E5; text-decoration: underline;">SmartPrüfung account</a>.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">2. Choose <strong>TELC Deutsch B1</strong> and start your free practice exam.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">3. After completing the exam, review your score and see how close you are to your goal.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">If you want to continue practicing, you can choose between:</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;"><strong>10 Exams — €9.99</strong><br>10 additional TELC B1 practice exams.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;"><strong>Unlimited Exams — €29.99</strong><br>Unlimited TELC B1 exam practice during your access period.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">Both are one-time payments with no automatic renewal.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">You can view your options here:</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;"><a href="https://app.smartpruefung.com/pricing?lang=en" target="_blank" style="color: #4F46E5; text-decoration: underline;">View SmartPrüfung plans</a></p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">If you have any questions or run into a problem, feel free to contact us. We’ll be happy to help.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">Good luck with your exam! 🇩🇪</p><p style="margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 160%;">Cheers,<br>Aziz from SmartPrüfung</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <table
          border="0"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          align="center"
          width="560"
          style="
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border-spacing: 0;
            padding: 0;
            width: inherit;
            max-width: 560px;
          "
        >
          <tr>
            <td
              align="center"
              valign="top"
              style="
                border-collapse: collapse;
                border-spacing: 0;
                margin: 0;
                padding-left: 6.25%;
                padding-right: 6.25%;
                width: 87.5%;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 400;
                line-height: 150%;
                padding-top: 20px;
                padding-bottom: 20px;
                color: #999999;
                font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
              "
              class="footer"
            >
Need help? Visit our <a href="https://smartpruefung.com/en/#faq" target="_blank" style="color: #4F46E5; text-decoration: underline;">FAQ</a> or contact us through our <a href="https://smartpruefung.com/en/contact" target="_blank" style="color: #4F46E5; text-decoration: underline;">Contact Form</a>.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>

</html>